@apiurl = http://127.0.0.1:3000

### Register
POST {{apiurl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Testi","email":"test9@test.com","password":"salakala","role":"patient"}

###

### Login
POST {{apiurl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"test9@test.com","password":"salakala"}

###

### GET Profile - kopioi token login Body.token Bearer <token>
GET {{apiurl}}/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer token tähä
### 

### PATCH
PATCH {{apiurl}}/api/users/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{"name":"Updated"}

###

### DELETE Account - Poistaa tilin pysyvästi!
DELETE {{apiurl}}/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

###
### Kubios Login (käytä omia tunnuksia!)
POST {{apiurl}}/api/auth/kubios-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": ""
}
### Get Me (Bearer + login-token!)
GET {{apiurl}}/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer 
### Kubios User Data (mittaukset JSON) - Bearer + login-token
GET {{apiurl}}/api/kubios/user-data
Authorization: Bearer token tähä
###

### Kubios User Info
GET {{apiurl}}/api/kubios/user-info
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_KUBIOS_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Uusi! Testaa login jälkeen (kopioi token).

### Sleep Diary - Lisää merkintä (kopioi token loginista!)
POST {{apiurl}}/api/sleep-diary
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer token tähä

{
  "date": "2026-04-15",
  "bedtime": "23:00",
  "wake_time": "07:00",
  "sleep_quality": "hyvin",
  "exercise": "jonkin verran",
  "mood": "hyvä",
  "comment": "Nukuin ihan hyvin, heräsin kerran yöllä"
}

###

### Sleep Diary - Hae kaikki omat merkinnät
GET {{apiurl}}/api/sleep-diary
Authorization: Bearer token tähä

###

### Synkkaa Kubios-data tietokantaan (käytä kubios-login tokenia!)
POST {{apiurl}}/api/analyses/sync
Authorization: Bearer token tähä

###

### Hae tallennetut analyysit
GET {{apiurl}}/api/analyses
Authorization: Bearer token tähä